    "If the power, water or internet fails, you need to manage on your own for the first three days. Noodkoffer helps you build and maintain your emergency kit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als stroom, water of internet uitvalt, moet je je de eerste drie dagen zelf redden. Noodkoffer helpt je je noodpakket samen te stellen en bij te houden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
